---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Principles & Ethics — KindMinds Trauma System">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
    <div class="space-y-3 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#f48d16]/10 border border-[#f48d16]/25 text-[#f48d16] text-xs font-semibold">
        <span>✦ Ethical & Clinical Framework</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#faf9f5] tracking-tight">The Trauma-Informed AI Manifesto</h1>
      <p class="text-[#a89f91] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Why conventional conversational chatbots fail victims of atrocities — and how KindMinds establishes an autonomous, non-retraumatizing clinical sanctuary.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-[#a89f91] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <div class="parley-bento-card rounded-[2rem] p-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="parley-number text-2xl font-bold text-[#756d62]">01.</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/10 border border-[#10b981]/25 text-[#10b981] text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Non-Retraumatization</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#faf9f5]">The Non-Retraumatization Imperative</h3>
        <p>
          Generic large language models are trained to be conversational and inquisitive, prompting users with questions like <em>"Can you tell me more about what happened?"</em> or <em>"Describe the event in detail."</em> For a survivor of torture, state terror, or sexual violence, this conversational probing forces them into vivid re-experiencing, inducing acute autonomic panic, flashbacks, and dissociation.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#f48d16] font-medium text-xs pt-1">
          KindMinds Protocol: Never interrogate, never demand forensic narrative, and anchor to the physical room whenever autonomic distress spikes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <div class="parley-bento-card rounded-[2rem] p-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="parley-number text-2xl font-bold text-[#756d62]">02.</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#f48d16]/10 border border-[#f48d16]/25 text-[#f48d16] text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Telemetry</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#faf9f5]">Real-Time Autonomic Distress Telemetry</h3>
        <p>
          Rather than treating every message as flat text, KindMinds deploys real-time function calling to assess nervous system distress (0.0 to 10.0 scale), classifying trauma states into <strong>Hyperarousal</strong> (fight-or-flight panic), <strong>Dissociation</strong> (depersonalization/numbing), <strong>Intrusive Distress</strong> (active flashback intrusion), or <strong>Acute Crisis</strong>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#a89f91] text-xs">
          This continuous telemetry allows the AI agent to immediately modulate its sentence rhythm, suggest sensory anchors, or trigger crisis escalation protocols before the survivor spirals into complete overwhelm.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <div class="parley-bento-card rounded-[2rem] p-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="parley-number text-2xl font-bold text-[#756d62]">03.</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#10b981]/10 border border-[#10b981]/25 text-[#10b981] text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Survivor Agency</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#faf9f5]">Survivor Agency Over Authoritative Commands</h3>
        <p>
          Victims of atrocities have experienced catastrophic violations of personal and physical autonomy. Being commanded by an AI—even with good intentions—can evoke feelings of coercion and helplessness.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#a89f91] text-xs">
          KindMinds consistently offers collaborative choices: <em>"Would you like us to pause and try a slow breath together, or would you prefer we focus on finding a safe physical place to rest?"</em> The survivor is always the director of their healing journey.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <div class="parley-bento-card rounded-[2rem] p-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="parley-number text-2xl font-bold text-[#756d62]">04.</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-[#fb3858]/10 border border-[#fb3858]/25 text-[#fb3858] text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Stealth Privacy</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#faf9f5]">Stealth Protection & Zero Behavioral Profiling</h3>
        <p>
          Survivors in conflict zones, oppressive regimes, or domestic violence situations risk retaliation if an abuser or authority discovers their searches. KindMinds operates with zero ad tracking, zero mandatory account creation, and a global double-tap ESC escape shield that wipes active memory and redirects to Google Weather instantly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 text-center">
      <a
        href="https://kindminds-dashboard.aakashbisht1204.workers.dev/triage"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#f48d16] text-stone-950 hover:bg-[#ff9c2b] transition-all shadow-lg shadow-[#f48d16]/20"
      >
        <span>Open Anonymous Triage Dashboard</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
